    "Put all three empty soda cans from the dining table inside the trash bin.",
    "Put the cookie and sandwich inside the refrigerator.",
    "Store the cutting board on the other storage counter.",
    "Finish with the refrigerator closed and the microwave switched off and closed.",
    "Finish with the preparation counter clear of the lunch box, four food items, tea, plates, forks, cutting board, cookie, and sandwich."
